Route21_North_Text_RonaldIntro::
	.string "Are the fish biting?\p"
	.string "Nothing bites here.\p"
	.string "Something in the\n"
	.string "water stopped them.$"

Route21_North_Text_RonaldDefeat::
	.string "Still stopped.$"

Route21_North_Text_RonaldPostBattle::
	.string "Whatever is down\n"
	.string "there doesn't\p"
	.string "want company.$"

Route21_North_Text_WadeIntro::
	.string "I got a big haul.\p"
	.string "I threw it back.\p"
	.string "What I pulled\n"
	.string "up wasn't fish.$"

Route21_North_Text_WadeDefeat::
	.string "Don't ask what it was.$"

Route21_North_Text_WadePostBattle::
	.string "Some things shouldn't\n"
	.string "come up from\p"
	.string "that depth.$"

Route21_North_Text_SpencerIntro::
	.string "The sea cleanses\n"
	.string "the body and soul.\p"
	.string "This water took\n"
	.string "something from me.\p"
	.string "I don't know what.$"

Route21_North_Text_SpencerDefeat::
	.string "Something else is gone.$"

Route21_North_Text_SpencerPostBattle::
	.string "I feel lighter.\p"
	.string "Not in a good way.$"

